15:For tmux-based lab primaries, `bin/fm-lab-home.sh` owns the short private socket directory; do not place `TMUX_TMPDIR` under the lab home or worktree.
16:Use `LAB_HOME_HELPER='/Users/eduardopicazo/.no-mistakes/worktrees/76ca871d9699/01M5QSTTBGYD8Y93JB8DSZBZYZ/bin/fm-lab-home.sh'` and run every lab tmux command through `"$LAB_HOME_HELPER" tmux "$FM_HOME" <arguments...>`, which addresses only the lab server by its `-S` socket with `TMUX` and `TMUX_PANE` unset.
17:Never run a bare `tmux` or one addressed only by `TMUX_TMPDIR` for the lab: inside any tmux pane, `TMUX` outranks `TMUX_TMPDIR` and that command reaches the operator's own tmux server.
18:A lab process that must run firstmate scripts outside a lab pane gets `TMUX_TMPDIR="$("$LAB_HOME_HELPER" tmux-dir "$FM_HOME")"` with `TMUX` and `TMUX_PANE` unset.
